      "id": "king-henry-the-fifth/sceneIV_11.6/p@139550",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [],
      "text": "But hark! what new alarum is this same?\nThe French have reinforc’d their scatter’d men.\nThen every soldier kill his prisoners;\nGive the word through.",
